00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.000
Someone commented last week that we didn't plan to be talking about Jesus' birth and

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:59.000
the circumstances surrounding that at this time of year. But God planned it that way. And I, for one,

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:05.000
am real grateful that Christmas is over. However, in the process, a lot more people know that

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:10.000
I don't celebrate Christmas. Because I think all of us have had the opportunity to say to people

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:15.000
when they say "Merry Christmas", and "what are your plans for the holidays?" I don't have any special

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:20.000
plans and I'm through with this holiday, why not? It was a good opportunity for all of us who were involved

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.000
in that kind of conversation to begin to teach the truth. Not only to the children, as Rashad

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:30.000
talked about, but to the people that are around us who don't know, who've never been exposed

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.000
and don't understand. And I think, Lydia, before we started that, one of the things I discovered

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:45.000
in the process was that I do know a lot, but I don't think about it anymore. So much happens on a daily

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:51.000
basis in this mosque. So much information is given to us. I do nothing. I just come here and the sky

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:56.000
opens up and there's more information. And that's true for all of us. It's overwhelming.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:00.000
And then, we're ready for the next week. We don't even have a chance to process that and there's something

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:09.000
else. So, when someone asks a question who doesn't come here and doesn't know Islam and God alone,

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:14.000
I find that my mind goes blank because I forget a lot of stuff. Because I don't know how to go

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:22.000
back to where they are. And so, this has been a real period of exercise for me to begin to teach people

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:26.000
things that I haven't thought about and that I have taken for granted for a very long time.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:32.000
These questions that people ask are very basic and they need to be answered by very basic answers,

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:41.000
which I have not thought about. I've just taken for granted as I move through this symphony of information that falls on us.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.000
In verse 61,

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:57.000
[3:61] If anyone argues with you after this knowledge has come to you, ... "Let us summon our children and your children, our women and your women, ourselves and yourselves, then ... invoke GOD's curse upon the liars."

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:03.000
These are the most valuable to us, our families. And

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:10.000
And I'm amazed at how many people insist on bringing this curse upon themselves and their families.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:17.000
They, they do fight their way to Hell. They insist that their way is correct and they will not hear anything.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:23.000
Even after they've asked the questions and you've answered them, they, they still won't hear. Their minds

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:28.000
are really closed. It is more than a veil. It is a barrier and it is solid.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:43.000
And verse 62, again, we have absolutely miraculous proof on a daily basis that what we're reading is God's Voice,

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:51.000
Living Voice to us. All we do is open this book and God is speaking to us. And we have proof of

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:55.000
that, absolute proof, so much proof that we don't even think about that anymore.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:06:01.000
We just wait to see how many more numbers there are and how do they fit together. There is absolutely no

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:06.000
way in. There's no way to assail this miracle. There's no way to destroy the code. It is now

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:13.000
so overwhelming. And that's only through Sura 1. We're stuck on Sura 1. I believe that if

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:18.000
all the methods and the research that we've used to date are applied to the rest of the Quran,

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.000
I think there's gonna be another torrent and it's gonna be literally years,

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:26.000
even with computers and with everyone working on it, and there are gonna be even more.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:33.000
How we are gonna teach this to other people, I don't know. We're talking about textbooks because

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:39.000
we've been brought along on a slow basis every day, every week, every month. And to begin to even

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:43.000
explore this with other people, it's, it's overwhelming.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:51.000
[3:63] If they dispute these facts, then GOD is fully aware of the evildoers.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.000
To you is yours and to me is mine.

