[109:2] "I do not worship what you worship. [109:3] "You do not worship what I worship.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.000
I'm not responsible for what you do. And you're not responsible for

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:11.000
what I do. It takes away the need for the argument. And God tells us not to waste

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:17.000
our time with people who do not believe. So, we need to remember that when we're talking with people. Just

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:22.000
leave them. This is what you believe. You've done the best you could. You've delivered the message.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.000
It's up to them. "God willing, you'll have to think about it after you leave."

