00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:53.000
or parts of birds were placed on various hills and falls to reassure that messenger's heart.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:09:00.000
I think the human being requires assurance, including the messengers and the prophets.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:08.000
There are examples all through the Quran of that where God teaches all of the human beings,

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:13.000
including His messengers and prophets. And they do need reassurance.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:19.000
It's very difficult to take the mantle of prophet and messenger on your shoulders and bear it.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:29.000
To ask over and over again "Why me? What's required of me?" Moses did that. Abraham. They all did. Lot. Noah.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:39.000
Catherine: And God supported them and reassured them. So, I think it's a human tendency and God chooses to support the messengers and the prophets more than the rest of us, thank God.

